Max Source Tree
===============

Under this directory
--------------------
CHANGE_LOG*	- detailed modification history.
aux/		- auxilary programs used/shipped with Max.
doc/		- documentation 
i/		- include files
m/		- Max module src lives here.
make/		- misc. files used for Make or config of Max.
max/		- final compile/link done here.
maxtcl/		- maxtcl code (cped from /mmi-cad/src/max/maxtcl)
mc2.0/		- megacell compiler (cped form /mmi-cad/src/max/mc2.0)
o/<config>	- executables and object files go here.
proto/		- runt time library files.


ENVIRONMENT ASSUMPTIONS
-----------------------
ANSII C.
POSIX.
GCC.
GNU MAKE.
X11.
TCL/TK.









